	(title_block
		(title "Outputs: 3 x 74HC595 (STOPPED, AT_HOME, END, POS0-14), 4 x TBD62783A, resettable fuses, PUL/DIR/ENA")
		(date "2026-11-15")
		(rev "A")
		(comment 1 "Decision 0003 2.2 sender rules: high >= 20 V at 30 mA, low <= 2 V, 0 V short proof (resettable fuse hold >= 30 mA / trip <= 100 mA per output; part number not confirmed)")
		(comment 2 "U60 (+24V_SW): STROBE, JUDGE, CLEAR (hardware gating) + PUL, DIR, ENA (drive).  U61-U63 (+24V_L): status and POS.  Every driver input has a 47k pull-down")
		(comment 3 "595 chain: MOSI -> U50 (bits 0-7) -> U51 (8-15) -> U52 (16-23); bit n = chip n//8, output Q(A + n%8); bits 18-23 spare")
	)
