	(text "DRV_PUL / DRV_DIR / DRV_ENA = 24 V high-side (+24V_SW) through 1.5k to the drive terminal J_DRV; PUL-, DIR-, ENA- are tied to 0 V at the drive.\nPulses: 400 per position = 2600 per motor revolution (4:1 belt, 26 positions per F axis revolution) (calculated)."
